  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "09. Movement Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "09.02",
    "order": 131,
    "anchor": "09.02",
    "summary": "The active player moves units 1 at a time until each has been **selected to move** and has finished. For each unit:\n\n1. Pick a friendly unit not yet selected to move in this phase; it can be in **strategic reserves**, on the battlefield or embarked in a **TRANSPORT**.\n2. Choose a move type it is eligible for and resolve it: **[Remain stationary](vsdata:core-rule/remain-stationary)**, **[Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)**, **[Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)**, **[Fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)**, **[Disembark move](vsdata:core-rule/disembark-move)**, **[Ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** or one from another rule.",
